WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.984 --> 00:00:05.160
[SINGING] Blackbird singing
in the dead of night.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:07.080
In the music world,
Jacob's huge.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:10.780
[SINGING] Take these broken
wings and learn to fly.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.710
There's this gig on Saturday--
it's going to be so crazy--

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:14.870
200 musicians on the stage.

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:16.846
[SINGING] I wish that
you could tell me

00:00:16.846 --> 00:00:26.634
something to change my mind but
you don't want to be my savior

00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:30.690
He's one of those once in
a lifetime kind of people

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.090
that changes the way
you look at things.

